@WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5254

### Pobierz kategorie
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/categories/
Accept: application/json

###

### Pobierz kategorię
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### Dodaj kategorię
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/categories/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Praca"
}

###

### Dodaj kontakt
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jan",
  "lastName": "Kowalski",
  "sex": "Male",
  "age": 30
}

###

### Edytuj kontakt
PUT {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jan",
  "lastName": "Nowak",
  "sex": "Male",
  "age": 31
}
